+# XML Configuration Loading Service
+
+## Overview
+
+This Maven project implements an XML configuration loading service that uses JAXP's `TransformerFactory` to perform identity transforms on XML configuration files.
+
+## Implementation Details
+
+### ConfigService Class
+
+**Location**: `src/main/java/com/example/service/ConfigService.java`
+
+**Method**: `Document loadConfig(String configPath)`
+
+**Features**:
+- Loads XML configuration files from the specified path
+- Performs identity transformation using `TransformerFactory`
+- Returns the transformed XML as a `org.w3c.dom.Document` object
+- Comprehensive input validation and error handling
+
+### Security Features
+
+The implementation includes robust security measures to prevent XML-based attacks:
+
+1. **XXE Protection**: Disables external entity processing
+   - Disallows DOCTYPE declarations
+   - Disables external general entities
+   - Disables external parameter entities
+
+2. **Secure Processing**: Enables `FEATURE_SECURE_PROCESSING` on both `TransformerFactory` and `DocumentBuilderFactory`
+
+3. **Access Control**: Restricts external DTD and stylesheet access
+
+### Exception Handling
+
+- `IllegalArgumentException`: Thrown when `configPath` is null or empty
+- `IOException`: Thrown when the configuration file does not exist
+- `TransformerException`: Thrown when XML parsing or transformation fails
+
+## Usage Example
+
+```java
+ConfigService service = new ConfigService();
+try {
+    Document config = service.loadConfig("/path/to/config.xml");
+    // Process the configuration document
+    String rootElement = config.getDocumentElement().getTagName();
+    System.out.println("Root element: " + rootElement);
+} catch (IOException e) {
+    System.err.println("File not found: " + e.getMessage());
+} catch (TransformerException e) {
+    System.err.println("XML transformation failed: " + e.getMessage());
+}
+```
+
+## Building and Testing
+
+```bash
+# Compile the project
+mvn clean compile
+
+# Run tests
+mvn test
+
+# Package the project
+mvn package
+```
+
+## Test Coverage
+
+The test suite includes:
+- Successful XML loading and transformation
+- File not found scenarios
+- Null and empty path validation
+- XML structure verification
+
+All tests pass successfully (4/4 tests).
+
+## Technology Stack
+
+- Java 8+
+- JAXP (Java API for XML Processing)
+- JUnit 4.13.2 for testing
